                                "sense_id": "5baa18ae-7a69-380b-800e-0b18c9ce6320",
                                "text": "Again and again, what shall we say of the Idle Aristocracy, the Owners of the Soil of England […] We will say mournfully, in the presence of Heaven and Earth, — that we stand speechless, stupent, and know not what to say!"
                            }
                        ]
